The robot model (kinematics, inertias, meshes and textures) in this package is
derived from GalaxyGeneralRobotics/galbot_s1_description
(https://github.com/GalaxyGeneralRobotics/galbot_s1_description),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE.upstream).

Modifications: glTF visual meshes converted to COLLADA, textures down-scaled to
2048 px, URDF converted to a xacro macro with a base_footprint link, sphere wheel
collisions, optional mimic joints, camera frames and simulation limit overrides
(see tools/import_upstream.py and the header of urdf/galbot_s1_body.xacro).
